      "side": 1,
      "message": "It cannot be achieved with in-process locks, since each test case is run in a separate process upstream. So we need NamedLocks for cross-process locks.\n\nhttps://crosvm.dev/book/testing.html#parallel-test-execution\n\nOr in more detail:\n\nhttps://nexte.st/book/how-it-works.html\n\nReplacing this with a mutex lock for running the test in AOSP seems reasonable, but may cause a maintenance burden in the long run. So I would recommend adding the the namedlock crate to AOSP.",
